The relevant bit of code is mbag_explodes, in pickup.c
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Pickup.c#line1735

The only types of objects that can cause an explosion are:
1) non-empty wands of cancellation;
2) objects with the 'is_mbag' flag set, unless they are empty bags of
tricks.

The 'is_mbag' flag is only set if an object is a bag of holding or a
bag of tricks:
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Obj.h#line222

So no, spellbooks of cancellation should never cause a magical
explosion.

